Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:01:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(2d): Face says it has no pass order on the Pass
 starts at row

Face cuts serpentine rows from one edge of the face to the other, so it
has no inside or outside pass order. The Face Passes tab now shows the
shared "Pass starts at" row, held at Auto and disabled, with the reason
in view. MCP edit_operation refuses pass_start on a Face with that
reason, not with the generic "unknown field". Face output and the
project file do not change.

Fixes #3356

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
